      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Wright‑Patterson AFB traces its roots to Wilbur Wright Field, opened May 22, 1917, and McCook Field, established the same year for aviation experiments.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        27,
