      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1995, presidents from Bosnia, Croatia, and Serbia met at Wright‑Patterson AFB to negotiate the Dayton Agreement that ended the Bosnian War.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
