      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Wright‑Patterson AFB houses the Air Force’s National Air and Space Intelligence Center and the Space Force’s National Space Intelligence Center, the nation’s top air and space threat analysts.",
